      "explain": "Followed by a question word to pose a question to the listener. This is a somewhat old-fashioned way of speaking, used only in spoken language and often by older men.",
      "note": null,
      "examples": [
        {
          "content": "彼誰だい。",
          "transcription": "かれだれだい。",
          "mean": "Who is he?"
        },
        {
          "content": "いつ行くだい。",
          "transcription": "いついくだい。",
          "mean": "When are you going?"
        },
        {
          "content": "どうだい。",
          "transcription": "どうだい。",
          "mean": "What do you think?"
        }
